  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Argentina&apos;s Social Protection and Inclusion System - Phase I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Apoyo al Sistema de Proteccion e Inclusin Social de Argentina - Fase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Racionalizar el Gasto Social de los Programas de Transferencia de Ingreso del Sistema de Proteccin Social tanto en su sistema contributivo como en el no contributivo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To streamline the Social Expenditure of income transfer programs of the Social Protection System in both its contributory system as in the non-contributory.</narrative>
  </description>
